    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mulungu Kūng'wisagīja Daūdi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Daūdi aho wigasha ū ng'wikūlū lyakwe ūlembeela, ūng'wīla ng'hangi Nasani gīkī, “Ū nene ī haha nalī mu numba yawiza ya mitī ya ng'wininga, alīyo ī lisandīko lya ng'wa SEEBA līlī ng'wiheema!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Nasani ūnshokeja ū ntemi alīhaya, “Gwītage ūyo ūlī nago ū mu ng'holò yako, nguno ū Mulungu alī hamò nang'ho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būjikū wenūbo ū mhayo gwa ng'wa Mulungu gūng'wizīīla ū Nasani; gūng'wīla gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Jaga ūkang'wīle ū ntūmami wane ū Daūdi, ‘Ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī: Ū bebe ūtūnizengela numba ya kwikala mo ū nene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūfuma ī likanza īlo nakabīnja a Baisilaeli mu Misili kūshisha lelo īyī, nataalī kwikala mu numba. Naakwījaga ī myaka nakūjaga ūko nū kūko, alīyo hose-hsoe būlī kwene ū wikalo wane iheema dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Līlīho īpandī lyose-lyose ūko naaja hamò nabo a banhū bane a Baisilaeli, hūna nūlūngalūnga na ntongeeji nūūlū ūmò ū mu banhū abo naabalagīlaga kūbadīīma, nūng'wīla gīkī: ‘Nibūlī ūtaalī kūnizengela numba ya mitī ya ng'wininga?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, ū ntūmami wane ū Daūdi ūkūng'wīla gīkī: ‘Ū SEEBA wa būddūla bose alīhaya gīkī: Ū bebe nakwīnja kū madīīmīlo, nūkūlecha nīmo gwa kūdīīma ng'holo nguno naalī natogilwee ūbize nsugi wa banhū bane Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene nalī hamò nang'ho būlī kwene ūko ūkūjaga, na a banishi bako nakūjaga nūbayagaja nene ū kū būtongi wako. Na lūūlū ī haha nakūlīkūja ī lina lyako, lībize gīt'ūmo galī mina ga bataale ba mu sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma a banhū bane a Baisilaeli nakūbabeegeja ipandī lyabo benekīlī, nabahambe ho gete, bapandīke kaya yabo ya wikomangīle; booye ū kwikala bakūkoyakoyiagwa. A banhū babūbi batūbakoya hangī gīt'ūmo bīītīlaga ī kwandya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno h'ūmo bakūbīītīlaga nī haha a banhū bane a Baisilaeli, kūfuma aho nandīja kūbatūūlīla balamuji. Nīyo nakūbanyangīlīja gete pye a banishi bako. Hama a h'igūlya ya yenīyo nalīkūwīla gīkī, ‘Ū SEEBA ng'wenekīlī akūkūbeegeja numba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shikū jako ūlū jūshila, lyūshika ikanza lya kūja kwikala na bakūlūgenji bako, nakūngūngūmūla ūmò wa mu būbyīle wako, ūmò wa bitūnja bako gete, abize ng'wingīji wako; ū būtemi wakwe nakūwinha nguzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wenūyo h'ūyo akūzenga numba kūlwa nguno ya lina lyane; ū nene nakūlyīta ī lisumbī lya būtemi bokwe līlame kūshisha welelo bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene nakūbiza Ise, ū wei akūbiza ng'wana wane. Ū būtogwa wane natīko ū kūng'wīngīja gīt'ūmo nakang'wīngīja ūyo walī ntongi wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wenūyo nakūng'wīta abize nsugi wa numba yane na būtemi wane welelo bose; ī lisumbī lyakwe lya būtemi līkūlama shikū jose ja welelo na welelo.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Nasani ūng'winha ū Daūdi ī mihayo ya koolekegeje kenaka pyī ūmo kagelelile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūlomba kwa ng'wa Daūdi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ntemi Daūdi wingīla mu gatī wigasha kū būtongi wa ng'wa SEEBA ūhaya, “SEEBA, ū nene nalī nani, nī kaya yane īlī kīnhū kī, nose ūnishishe mu mbika gītī īyī? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee Mulungu, ū mhayo gwenūyū ū mu miso gako gūlībiza gītī gūlī ndo no, nguno a higūlya ya henaho ongejaga na kūyomba mihayo ya numba ya ntūmami wako kūlwa shikū ja kū būtongi. Ee SEEBA Mulungu, ū bebe ūlīniisaaba gītī gīkī nalī munhū ntaale no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī lūūlū ū Daūdi ongenje mhayo kī gūngī ū gwa kūkūwīla kūlw'ikūjo īlo wang'wīlūkīlaga ū ntūmami wako? Nguno ū bebe ūndeebile gete ū ntūmami wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee Seeba, ū mhayo ū ntaale gwenūyū wang'wītīlaga ū ntūmami wako bebe ng'wenekīlī mu kasolele ka ng'holò yako, ūng'oolekeja nī mitaale-mitaale ī ya kwisagīja kwako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee SEEBA, atīho ūngī wa kūlenganījiwa nang'ho, na atīho Mulungu ūngī ūlū ūtī bebe wike, gīt'ūmo twigwīla na matū gise benekīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Līlīho ihanga kī līngī ū mu sī īlo līdūgije kūlenganījiwa na Baisilaeli banhū bako, abo Mulungu akaja kūbakomoola gīkī babize bakwe, wibeegeje lina kūlwa nguno yako bebe ng'wenekīlī; hūna ūbeeja mihayo mitaale ya kooghya na kūkamaaja: ūpeeja mahanga ga banhū gīkī babīngīle banhū bako abo ūkabakomoola kūfuma Misili? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bebe ng'wenekīlī ūbīīta a banhū bako a Baisilaeli kūbiza bako ba wikomangīle welelo bose. Na ng'hana SEEBA, ūbiza Mulungu wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū SEEBA Mulungu, ū mhayo ūyo wagūhayaga kūlwa nguno yane nene ntūmami wako nī numba yane, ni gwīmīīlage gīko shikū jose welelo na welelo. Ītaga gīt'ūmo kūlī kwisagīja kwako, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "īje gīko, ī lina lyako līgūngūhiwe welelo bose; hūna lūūlū a hanhū bakūhaya gīkī, ‘Ū SEEBA wa būdūla bose, ū Mulugnu wa Baisilaeli, hū ng'wene ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli!’ Hūna ī kaya ya ntūmami wako ū Daūdi īkūlama ū kū būtongi wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū bebe Mulungu wane, hū bebe wankundūlīlaga ū ntūmami wako ū mhayo gwenūyū, ī gīkī ūkūnzengela numba. Hī nguno yene ū ntūmai wako wapandīkaga būshisha-ng'holò wa kūkūlomba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee SEEBA, ū bebe hū ūlī Mulungu! Bebe hū wang'wisagījaga ū ntūmami wako ī mihayo yawiza īyī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ni gūkūyejage ū gwa kwīyīlūkīla mbango ī numba ya ntūmami wako, īhangame ū kū būtongi wako shikū jose ja welelo na welelo. Nguno ū bebe SEEBA wīyīlūkīla mbango ī numba ya ntūmami wako, ng'hana īkūbiza na mbango welelo bose.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
